        "Background": "Raised on shoujo manga, Fukiko never expected her own fantasies to come true — until a strange winged cat named Azyrus appeared at her window one night and revealed that her late mother had secretly been a magical crime fighter. Fukiko's locket, a keepsake from her mother, turned out to hold that same power, and so the heroine Lovely Savior Myu Myu was born.",
        "Personality": "Strong-willed and naive, Fukiko expects the world to play fair by her own rules. That same faith lets her see the good in bad situations, though her childish streak can also mean a fair amount of whining."
