      "fields": {
        "Background": "Fukiko: Lines in Full\n+3 Barrier [Perks: Area Effect; Flaws: Elaborate Gestures; 5 Endurance]\n-2 Focus (Powers Require Neko Transformation Locket)\n\nFukiko: Ability Notes\nBarrier: provides an alternate Defense Roll (the second Defense value in Combat, below)\n\nFukiko: Attacks\nNeko Neko Catnip Cantrip: In her magical girl form, Fukiko can perform a variety of mystical attacks of love.\nNeko Neko Heart Burst: Fukiko forms her hands into the shape of a heart over her chest and emits a barrage of magical heart-shaped bursts.\nNeko Neko Wave: With a waving motion of her arms, Fukiko pushes away all opponents around her.\nNeko Neko Yarn Entangle: A ball of yarn magically appears and wraps around her target.\n\nFukiko: Lovely Savior Myu Myu\nClutching her locket and shouting her transformation phrase turns Fukiko into her cat-themed magical-girl form, right down to a bell collar and a whole new outfit — villains seem oddly willing to wait out the sequence. She can also use this power just to change her appearance, but not while also using Shape-Shifter.",
        "Appearance": "Fukiko: Azyrus\nBeneath his cute exterior, Azyrus is a steady source of advice for Fukiko, even when her naivete exasperates him."
      }
